  "description": "Studio apartment \nWe are delighted to present this beautiful studio apartment in the heart of Ranelagh Village.  The property is newly renovated and is tastefully furnished with stylish and modern designs. This bright and airy studio comprise a kitchen/living area, double bed with storage and large wardrobes. \n\n•\tNewly renovated \n•\tB1 rated, PV panels, high level insulation and energy      efficient heating\n•\tHigh speed WiFi and Bins included \n•\tFully fitted kitchens with washer/dryer, induction hob, Fridge freezer, integrated oven and microwave\n•\tPower shower with rain head \n•\tHigh level sound proofing \n•\tFully furnished \n\nRanelagh is understandably one of the most sought after locations in Dublin. The area is home to beautiful parks such as nearby Herbert Park and Belgrave Square.  St. Stephen’s Green and Grafton street are a 15 minute walk away.  Well-connected by public transport, there are a selection of bus routes on your doorstep, and a Luas stop just a 5-minute stroll away. \n\nThere are numerous high-end restaurants, cafés and specialist shops to choose from and a wide selection of sports clubs and gyms in the area.\n\nViewing by appointment.",
